@baseUrl = https://localhost:7188

### 1. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. List documents (fresh local start includes the seeded governance policy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Ingest text directly
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/ingest-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "security-policy.txt",
  "content": "Production credentials must be stored in Azure Key Vault. Privileged access requires manager approval and security validation."
}

###

### 4. Ask a grounded RAG question
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rag/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Who approves privileged access requests?",
  "topK": 4,
  "minimumSimilarityScore": 0.02
}

###

### 5. Ask a second policy question
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rag/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Where should production secrets be stored?",
  "topK": 4,
  "minimumSimilarityScore": 0.02
}

###

### 6. Negative grounding test — should not invent unsupported information
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rag/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the company vacation policy?",
  "topK": 4,
  "minimumSimilarityScore": 0.50
}

###

### 7. Delete example
# Replace the GUID with a value returned by GET /api/documents.
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
